      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Native files.list is GET /v1/files with no query, matching the official curl. The pinned list_files schema uses after/limit/order while the current SDK documents page/page_size; those filters are omitted rather than guessed."
