      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Optional page and page_size are sent as query parameters. The pinned GET handler would also serialize leftover filters (deployment_chat, sources, name, search, id, metadata) as query; those are omitted because native templates cannot express leftover-input query fanout without unused or unstructured inputs."
      ]
    }
